<div class="hero">
  <h1 class="mos-content-heading">Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p class="saved-message">Masters Of Sight collects your email address when you create an account, so you can save masters to your board and sign back in later. That's it.</p>
  <p class="saved-message">Your email is never sold, shared, or used for anything beyond signing you in and, if you choose to subscribe, sending Stay in the Frame updates.</p>
  <p class="saved-message">You can delete your account and all your saved data at any time from your board page, no need to ask. It's permanent and takes effect immediately.</p>
  <p class="saved-message">Questions, reach out at <a class="saved-state-link" href="mailto:hello@mastersofsight.com">hello@mastersofsight.com</a>.</p>
</div>
